  "description": "Beta: An always-learning neural concurrency tuner for EvalApp. A holographic policy model (HoloFormer, d48/L2/K2/shifts8) plugs into your app's resource gates and keeps retuning online as conditions shift — it matches the built-in heuristic on clean pipelines and beats it by roughly 23-32% on coupled, noisy workloads (a benchmark with three coupled resource gates: database, disk, and CPU). Ships warm-started, minimal overhead, never frozen. Opt in with .WithNeuralTuning().",
